{"articleNo":"582717","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=582717&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2026학년도 겨울 계절수업 정원 외 수강신청 안내","writer":"교무과","writeDate":"2026.11.18","hit":"23","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2026</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 18pt;\">학년도 겨울 계절수업 정원 외 수강신청 안내</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">유의사항 :</span></b></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-&nbsp; 2026학년도 겨울계절수업은&nbsp; 정해진 수강료납부기간(12.1 ~12.3, 3일간)외에는 </span></b></span><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">수강료 추가납부기간이 운영되지 않으니,</span></b></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 반드시 기간 내 수업료를 납부완료하기 바랍니다.</span></b></span><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(미납시 수강취소됨)</span></b></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><font color=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- 2과목 수강 신청 시 1과목만&nbsp; 수강취소 불가</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(2과목 수강신청자가 1과목 수업료만 납부할 경우 2과목 모두 수강 취소 됨)</span><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 1rem;\"></b></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">정원 외 수강신청을 위하여 수강정원을 임시조정하였으므로 개설된 모든 과목은 정원 외 수강신청이 가능하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;기간 내 수강신청을 완료하여주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">.(추후 수강신청 불가)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"19069\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><table width=\"876px\" style=\"width: 1140px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothi